      "id": "FR-001",
      "title": "A completed ordinary round-three wait whose immutable verdict is pass MUST become ordinary exhaustion only when the exact-head required checks have settled red and claim turnover satisfies the existing recovery preconditions. (Stories: US-001; Acceptance: AC-001)",
      "text": "A completed ordinary round-three wait whose immutable verdict is pass MUST become ordinary exhaustion only when the exact-head required checks have settled red and claim turnover satisfies the existing recovery preconditions. (Stories: US-001; Acceptance: AC-001)",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
